# WEB / APP SECURITY TOOLS

Registered tools for the Web & Application Security domain:
- proxy_collect — capture request/response flows for the
  authorized target.
- http_history — read collected HTTP traffic.
- endpoint_map — map discovered endpoints and APIs.
- app_structure — characterize application architecture and
  components.

Execute in investigation order: collect → read history → map
endpoints → characterize structure. Work only against the
authorized target; record observations verbatim. Never fabricate
a request, response, endpoint, or security finding.
